{"id": "garga_hora_sutra_1", "original_text": "Jupiter in his own house along with Saturn and Mercury will bestow long life. Such native often will beget wealth.", "conditions": {"operator": "AND", "clauses": [{"type": "planet_state", "planet": "Jupiter", "relation_to_sign": "Own House"}, {"type": "conjunction", "planets": ["Jupiter", "Saturn", "Mercury"]}]}, "effects": [{"category": "longevity", "description": "The native will have a long life.", "impact": "Positive", "intensity": "High", "probability": "Likely"}, {"category": "wealth", "description": "The native will often beget wealth.", "impact": "Positive", "intensity": "Medium", "probability": "Likely"}], "metadata": {"source_name": "samplepdf1-20.txt", "confidence": "High"}}
{"id": "garga_hora_sutra_2", "original_text": "Should Venus be in Pisces along with Jupiter and the Moon, the native will acquire kingly fortunes and will have many sons and family.", "conditions": {"operator": "AND", "clauses": [{"type": "planet_state", "planet": "Venus", "sign": "Pisces"}, {"type": "conjunction", "planets": ["Venus", "Jupiter", "Moon"]}]}, "effects": [{"category": "status", "description": "The native will acquire kingly fortunes.", "impact": "Positive", "intensity": "High", "probability": "Likely"}, {"category": "family", "description": "The native will have many sons and family.", "impact": "Positive", "intensity": "High", "probability": "Likely"}], "metadata": {"source_name": "samplepdf1-20.txt", "confidence": "High"}}
{"id": "garga_hora_sutra_3", "original_text": "Should the Ascendant be ina malefic Rasi, while the Lord thereof occupies the 7‘ house and Jupiter is posited in the 8°\" along with the Sun, the child will die at the age of eight.", "conditions": {"operator": "AND", "clauses": [{"type": "house_state", "house": 1, "sign_type": "malefic"}, {"type": "planet_state", "planet": {"selector": "lord_of_house", "house": 1}, "house": 7}, {"type": "planet_state", "planet": "Jupiter", "house": 8}, {"type": "conjunction", "planets": ["Jupiter", "Sun"], "house": 8}]}, "effects": [{"category": "longevity", "description": "The child will die at the age of eight.", "impact": "Negative", "intensity": "High", "probability": "Certain", "context": "Death at age 8"}], "metadata": {"source_name": "samplepdf1-20.txt", "confidence": "High"}}
{"id": "garga_hora_sutra_4", "original_text": "If Mercury and Mars be together in the Ascendant, or 6'\", or 8'\", the native will either be a thief, or will indulge in awful acts. Such a person will have defect in his hands and legs.", "conditions": {"operator": "OR", "clauses": [{"type": "conjunction", "planets": ["Mercury", "Mars"], "house": 1}, {"type": "conjunction", "planets": ["Mercury", "Mars"], "house": 6}, {"type": "conjunction", "planets": ["Mercury", "Mars"], "house": 8}]}, "effects": [{"category": "character", "description": "The native will either be a thief, or will indulge in awful acts.", "impact": "Negative", "intensity": "High", "probability": "Likely"}, {"category": "health", "description": "The native will have a defect in his hands and legs.", "impact": "Negative", "intensity": "Medium", "probability": "Likely"}], "metadata": {"source_name": "samplepdf1-20.txt", "confidence": "High"}}
{"id": "garga_hora_sutra_5", "original_text": "Mercury in the Ascendant, or 6\", or 8\" can cause death at the age of 4. Even if the native is dipped in nectar, it will be of no avail.", "conditions": {"operator": "OR", "clauses": [{"type": "planet_state", "planet": "Mercury", "house": 1}, {"type": "planet_state", "planet": "Mercury", "house": 6}, {"type": "planet_state", "planet": "Mercury", "house": 8}]}, "effects": [{"category": "longevity", "description": "Death at the age of 4.", "impact": "Negative", "intensity": "High", "probability": "Certain", "context": "Death at age 4"}], "metadata": {"source_name": "samplepdf1-20.txt", "confidence": "High"}}
{"id": "garga_hora_sutra_6", "original_text": "Mars and Jupiter in exchange in Rasi will inflict death at the age of 12. Even though Lord Siva may desire to save the person, it is rare to escape death in such a Case.", "conditions": {"operator": "AND", "clauses": [{"type": "parivartana_yoga", "planets": ["Mars", "Jupiter"]}]}, "effects": [{"category": "longevity", "description": "Death at the age of 12.", "impact": "Negative", "intensity": "High", "probability": "Certain", "context": "Death at age 12"}], "metadata": {"source_name": "samplepdf1-20.txt", "confidence": "High"}}
{"id": "garga_hora_sutra_7", "original_text": "Should Jupiter occupy a house of Mars identical with 2\", 6'\", or 8'\" from Lagna, this child doubtlessly will face death in its sixth year.", "conditions": {"operator": "OR", "clauses": [{"type": "planet_state", "planet": "Jupiter", "house": 2, "sign_lord": "Mars"}, {"type": "planet_state", "planet": "Jupiter", "house": 6, "sign_lord": "Mars"}, {"type": "planet_state", "planet": "Jupiter", "house": 8, "sign_lord": "Mars"}]}, "effects": [{"category": "longevity", "description": "Death in the sixth year.", "impact": "Negative", "intensity": "High", "probability": "Certain", "context": "Death at age 6"}], "metadata": {"source_name": "samplepdf1-20.txt", "confidence": "High"}}
{"id": "garga_hora_sutra_8", "original_text": "If Rahu occupies the Ascendant at birth, while the Moon is in the 6'°/9\"\", the child will die within 20 days of birth. Similar effects will prevail, if Rahu is in the 4°\" from Lagna, while the Moon occupies one of the angles.", "conditions": {"operator": "OR", "clauses": [{"operator": "AND", "clauses": [{"type": "planet_state", "planet": "Rahu", "house": 1}, {"operator": "OR", "clauses": [{"type": "planet_state", "planet": "Moon", "house": 6}, {"type": "planet_state", "planet": "Moon", "house": 9}]}]}, {"operator": "AND", "clauses": [{"type": "planet_state", "planet": "Rahu", "house": 4}, {"type": "planet_state", "planet": "Moon", "house_type": "Kendra"}]}]}, "effects": [{"category": "longevity", "description": "The child will die within 20 days of birth.", "impact": "Negative", "intensity": "High", "probability": "Certain", "context": "Death within 20 days"}], "metadata": {"source_name": "samplepdf1-20.txt", "confidence": "High"}}
{"id": "garga_hora_sutra_9", "original_text": "Death will be inflicted by Rahu in the 7\" from Lagna, while the Moon is in the Ascendant. Even nectar will not be useful to him and the death will come to pass in the 10\" year of the child.", "conditions": {"operator": "AND", "clauses": [{"type": "planet_state", "planet": "Rahu", "house": 7}, {"type": "planet_state", "planet": "Moon", "house": 1}]}, "effects": [{"category": "longevity", "description": "Death in the 10th year.", "impact": "Negative", "intensity": "High", "probability": "Certain", "context": "Death at age 10"}], "metadata": {"source_name": "samplepdf1-20.txt", "confidence": "High"}}
{"id": "garga_hora_sutra_10", "original_text": "If the Moon is in the 12\" from Lagna, while malefics are in the 6'\" house, the native will be shortlived. He will suffer from stomachial disorders.", "conditions": {"operator": "AND", "clauses": [{"type": "planet_state", "planet": "Moon", "house": 12}, {"type": "planet_state", "planet_type": "malefic", "house": 6}]}, "effects": [{"category": "longevity", "description": "The native will be short-lived.", "impact": "Negative", "intensity": "High", "probability": "Likely"}, {"category": "health", "description": "The native will suffer from stomachial disorders.", "impact": "Negative", "intensity": "Medium", "probability": "Likely"}], "metadata": {"source_name": "samplepdf1-20.txt", "confidence": "High"}}
